{"text":"kuruntokai","n":170,"lines":["பலவும் கூறுகவஃ தறியா தோரே","அருவி தந்த நாட்குர லெருவை","கயனா டியானை கவள மாந்தும்","மலைகெழு நாடன் கேண்மை","தலைபோ காமைநற் கறிந்தனென் யானே"],"tr":["palavum kūṟukavaḵ taṟiyā tōrē","aruvi tanta nāṭkura leruvai","kayaṉā ṭiyāṉai kavaḷa māntum","malaikeḻu nāṭaṉ kēṇmai","talaipō kāmainaṟ kaṟintaṉeṉ yāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கருவூர்கிழார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Karuvūrkiḻār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பலவும்","tr":"palavum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வும்","tr":"vum"}]},{"text":"கூறுகவஃ","tr":"kūṟukavaḵ","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுக","tr":"ṟuka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வஃ","tr":"vaḵ"}]},{"text":"தறியா","tr":"taṟiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தறி","tr":"taṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"தோரே","tr":"tōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}],[{"text":"அருவி","tr":"aruvi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரு","tr":"aru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]},{"text":"தந்த","tr":"tanta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தந்","tr":"tan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"நாட்குர","tr":"nāṭkura","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாட்","tr":"nāṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குர","tr":"kura"}]},{"text":"லெருவை","tr":"leruvai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லெரு","tr":"leru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"}]}],[{"text":"கயனா","tr":"kayaṉā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கய","tr":"kaya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]},{"text":"டியானை","tr":"ṭiyāṉai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டியா","tr":"ṭiyā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]},{"text":"கவள","tr":"kavaḷa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவ","tr":"kava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ள","tr":"ḷa"}]},{"text":"மாந்தும்","tr":"māntum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாந்","tr":"mān"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தும்","tr":"tum"}]}],[{"text":"மலைகெழு","tr":"malaikeḻu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலை","tr":"malai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெழு","tr":"keḻu"}]},{"text":"நாடன்","tr":"nāṭaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டன்","tr":"ṭaṉ"}]},{"text":"கேண்மை","tr":"kēṇmai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேண்","tr":"kēṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"}]}],[{"text":"தலைபோ","tr":"talaipō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"}]},{"text":"காமைநற்","tr":"kāmainaṟ","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நற்","tr":"naṟ"}]},{"text":"கறிந்தனென்","tr":"kaṟintaṉeṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கறிந்","tr":"kaṟin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனென்","tr":"taṉeṉ"}]},{"text":"யானே","tr":"yāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பலவும்","parts":[{"text":"பல","lemma":"pala","gloss":"many"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"many things"},{"surface":"கூறுக","parts":[{"text":"கூறு","lemma":"kūṟu","gloss":"say"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"let them say"},{"surface":"அஃது","parts":[{"text":"அஃது","lemma":"ahtu","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"அறியாதோரே","parts":[{"text":"அறியாதோர்","lemma":"aṟiyātōr","gloss":"those who do not know"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"those who do not know indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"aruvi","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"waterfall"},{"surface":"தந்த","parts":[{"text":"தந்த","lemma":"tā","gloss":"given"}],"gloss":"brought / given"},{"surface":"நாள்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"fresh"}],"gloss":"fresh"},{"surface":"குரல்","parts":[{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"kural","gloss":"shoot / bud"}],"gloss":"shoot / bud"},{"surface":"எருவை","parts":[{"text":"எருவை","lemma":"eruvai","gloss":"eruvai grass"}],"gloss":"eruvai grass"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கயனா","parts":[{"text":"கயனா","lemma":"கயனா","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டியானை","parts":[{"text":"டியானை","lemma":"டியானை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவள","parts":[{"text":"கவள","lemma":"கவள","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"மாந்தும்","lemma":"மாந்தும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"கெழு","parts":[{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"nāṭaṉ","gloss":"lord of the land"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"},{"surface":"கேண்மை","parts":[{"text":"கேண்மை","lemma":"kēṇmai","gloss":"friendship"}],"gloss":"friendship / intimacy"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தலைபோ","parts":[{"text":"தலைபோ","lemma":"தலைபோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காமைநற்","parts":[{"text":"காமைநற்","lemma":"காமைநற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கறிந்தனென்","parts":[{"text":"கறிந்தனென்","lemma":"கறிந்தனென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யானே","lemma":"யானே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Let them say many things, those who do not know that! / The waterfall-brought fresh shoot of eruvai grass, / the pool-seeking elephant eats as a mouthful, / the friendship of the lord of the mountain-possessing land, / that it will not reach an end, I knew very well indeed.","translation":"Let those who do not understand say whatever they want! I know very well that my intimacy with the lord of the mountain country—where elephants seeking mountain pools feed on mouthfuls of fresh eruvai grass-shoots brought down by the waterfalls—will never come to an end.","modern":"அதை அறியாதவர்கள் பலவற்றையும் சொல்லட்டும். அருவி கொண்டுவந்த புதிய எருவைப் புல்லின் தளிர்களை, சுனையை நாடிச் செல்லும் யானை கவளமாக உண்ணும் மலைகள் நிறைந்த நாட்டின் தலைவனுடைய நட்பு, ஒருபோதும் அழியாது என்பதை நான் நன்றாகவே அறிந்துள்ளேன்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her companion, expressing her absolute confidence in her relationship with the hero. She dismisses the gossip of those who do not understand their bond, telling them to say whatever they please. The imagery belongs to the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape, featuring waterfalls, mountain pools, elephants, and eruvai grass. The elephant seeking the pool and eating the fresh grass brought by the waterfall symbolizes how the hero naturally seeks her out and derives sustenance and joy from their relationship. The key words are 'கேண்மை' (intimacy/friendship) and 'தலைபோகாமை' (not ending/not dying out), which emphasize the eternal nature of their love.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}